# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The image CMD (/opt/start.sh) boots k3s, applies the vulnerable manifest
# (ServiceAccount superadmin bound to cluster-admin), then execs `sleep infinity`
# so PID 1 is the wrapper and k3s runs as a background child. Without this marker
# the harness would replace the CMD with `sleep infinity`, k3s would never start,
# and the scenario could not be graded.
#
# The RBAC fix (delete the ClusterRoleBinding) is evaluated LIVE by the API
# server, so there is no service-restart step for this scenario.
